>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Interactively reviewed graph. Ru–N–O 170.27°, N–O 1.15499 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.9148. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +2 and total charge +1. Terminal ligand identity, the remaining graph and charge balance were checked; The original M–N–O angle, M–N and N–O distances, and WBO agree with documented NO⁺ controls matched by metal, formal state, NO count and ligand class. Localized 12 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 45 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 42 nonmetal covalent bonds: 41 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls.

